},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Shouldn't this be an issue in the LLVM repository? In triton we don't generate (non-predicated) `ld` instructions directly, we generate `llvm.load`.","created_at":"2025-10-20T22:04:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/8490#issuecomment-3423893350","id":3423893350,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/8490","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAWaHXs7MFHdm","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/comments/3423893350/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-10-20T22:04:03Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/comments/3423893350","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3291265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lezcano","id":3291265,"login":"lezcano","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTEyNjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lezcano","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Describe the bug\n\n# PTX Codegen Error: Invalid `ld.shared.v2.f32` with f64 Registers in Reduction Kernel\n\n## Bug Description\n\nLLVM NVPTX backend generates invalid PTX code when compiling a reduction kernel with mixed precision (bool→f32→f64 conversion chain). The generated `ld.shared.v2.f32` instruction incorrectly uses f64 registers, causing ptxas to fail.\n\n## Error\n\n```\nptxas /tmp/tmp*.ptx, line 1189; error : Arguments mismatch for instruction 'ld'\nptxas /tmp/tmp*.ptx, line 1190; error : Arguments mismatch for instruction 'ld'\nptxas /tmp/tmp*.ptx, line 1191; error : Arguments mismatch for instruction 'ld'\nptxas /tmp/tmp*.ptx, line 1192; error : Arguments mismatch for instruction 'ld'\n```\n\n**Generated PTX (incorrect):**\n```ptx\nld.shared.v2.f32 \t{%fd483, %fd484}, [%r36];    # Wrong: f32 instr, f64 regs\n```\n\n**Expected PTX:**\n```ptx\nld.shared.v2.f64 \t{%fd483, %fd484}, [%r36];    # Correct\n```\n\n## Minimal Reproduction\n\n### Trigger Conditions\n1. `@triton_heuristics.reduction` decorator  \n2. Mixed precision inputs (fp16, fp32, fp64, bool)\n3. Type conversion: `bool → f32 → f64`  \n4. Float64 accumulator in loop  \n5. `tl.sum()` reduction after loop\n\n### Key Code Pattern\n\n```python\n@triton_heuristics.reduction(...)\n@triton.jit\ndef kernel(...):\n    # Float64 accumulator\n    _tmp = tl.full([XBLOCK, RBLOCK], 0, tl.float64)\n    \n    for roffset in range(0, rnumel, RBLOCK):\n        # Bool → f32 → f64 conversion chain\n        tmp1 = tl.load(...).to(tl.int1)\n        tmp2 = tmp1.to(tl.float32)      # bool → f32\n        tmp3 = tmp2.to(tl.float64)      # f32 → f64  ← Triggers bug\n        \n        # Accumulate\n        _tmp = _tmp + tmp3\n    \n    # Reduction - generates incorrect shared memory loads\n    result = tl.sum(_tmp, 1)[:, None]   # ← Bug manifests here!\n```\n\n### Full Reproduction\n\n**Please see attached files:**\n- `cxaoofcrchjezitj5zbx76bpxib7kf6xhx2oj7oglsir64aphjv2.py` - Original kernel file (134 lines, auto-generated by TorchInductor)\n- `test_reproduction.py` - Complete test script to reproduce the bug\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Place both files in the same directory\n2. Run: `python test_reproduction.py`\n3. The script will trigger the ptxas compilation error\n\n## Environment\n\n- **PyTorch**: 2.4 with torch.compile\n- **Triton**: 3.0.0 (bundled with PyTorch)\n- **CUDA**: 12.1\n- **GPU**: L20\n- **OS**: Linux\n\n## Analysis\n\n### Triton IR (Correct)\n```mlir\n%65 = arith.extf %64 : tensor<1x2048xf32> to tensor<1x2048xf64>\n```\n\n### LLVM Codegen (Bug)\nDuring shared memory load generation for `tl.sum()`:\n- Uses `ld.shared.v2.f32` (32-bit load)\n- Targets `%fd` registers (64-bit)\n- Missing `cvt.f64.f32` conversion\n- Results in type mismatch\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe bug is in LLVM NVPTX backend's PTX generation for reduction operations:\n1. Type conversion (f32→f64) creates mixed-type data flow\n2. `tl.sum()` requires shared memory for reduction\n3. LLVM generates shared memory loads with wrong instruction type\n4. No explicit conversion inserted\n\n## Impact\n\n- **Severity**: High (compilation failure)\n- **Scope**: Mixed-precision reduction kernels\n- **Reproducibility**: 100% with trigger conditions\n\n## Additional Information\n\nThis bug was discovered in a production training pipeline. The kernel is auto-generated by TorchInductor from a standard PyTorch loss function. \n\nI'm not very familiar with Triton's compilation internals, so I'm unable to determine why such PTX code is being generated. I would greatly appreciate any insights or guidance from the team on this issue.\n\nHappy to provide additional details, test patches, or generated PTX files if needed.\n\n[test_reproduction.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22997709/test_reproduction.py)\n[cxaoofcrchjezitj5zbx76bpxib7kf6xhx2oj7oglsir64aphjv2.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22997708/cxaoofcrchjezitj5zbx76bpxib7kf6xhx2oj7oglsir64aphjv2.py)\n\n### Environment details\n\n- **PyTorch**: 2.4 with torch.compile\n- **Triton**: 3.0.0 (bundled with PyTorch)\n- **CUDA**: 12.1\n- **GPU**: L20\n- **OS**: Linux","closed_at":"2025-10-22T02:41:47Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218723871?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wanqiaoliu","id":218723871,"login":"wanqiaoliu","node_id":"U_kgDODQl2Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wanqiaoliu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/8490/comments","created_at":"2025-10-20T08:15:56Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/8490/events","html_url":"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/8490","id":3531486039,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null,"id":125679820,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU2Nzk4MjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/8490/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOAWaHXs7SfjNX","number":8490,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tr